# Task 1 – Data Analysis

## Overview
Analyzed a provided fraud-related dataset using Splunk Enterprise to identify and visualize trends and patterns in cyber data.

## Work Completed
- Imported and explored the provided dataset in Splunk Enterprise.
- Created a fraud detection dashboard using multiple data visualizations.
- Analyzed transaction activity by category, merchant, age, gender, and transaction step.
- Used charts and tables to communicate patterns and findings within the dataset.

## Tools & Skills
- Splunk Enterprise
- Data Analysis
- Data Visualization
- Dashboard Development
- Cyber Data Analysis

## Deliverable
A five-page Fraud Detection Dashboard was created in Splunk to visualize the results of the analysis.
